Thanks for filing this! I was able to confirm this behaviour with 0.12.20. My reproduction steps:

1. Create `main.tf`:

    ```hcl
    resource null_resource example {
      count = 1

      triggers = {
        index = count.index
      }
    }

    # resource example_resource whatever {}

    terraform {
      backend "s3" {
        bucket = "your-bucket"
        key = "remote-state/tf-example"
        region = "us-east-1"
        dynamodb_table = "your-dynamodb-table"
      }
    }
    ```
1. `terraform init`, `terraform apply` to create a state version
1. Uncomment the example resource
1. `terraform import example_resource.whatever abc123` to trigger a missing provider error

This last step fails and leaves a dangling lock.
